Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: runsuite.c
Line: 819
Function: rngTestStreaming
Bug type: use-after-free
CWE: CWE-416
Explanation: schema_doc is freed at line 818 immediately after creating rng_parser_ctx from it. rng_parser_ctx retains a pointer to the freed xmlDoc, and xmlRelaxNGParse(rng_parser_ctx) at line 819 will dereference that freed memory, leading to a use-after-free.

